WEBVTT

00:00:01.540 --> 00:00:03.500
This is the target I must execute:

00:00:03.710 --> 00:00:06.170
The otherworlder, Akari Tokitou.

00:00:06.330 --> 00:00:08.380
Even if she is killed,

00:00:08.380 --> 00:00:13.170
she possesses the Pure Concept of Time
that lets her rewind time to before her death.

00:00:11.670 --> 00:00:13.170
<b><i>Invoke [Regression]</i></b>

00:00:14.380 --> 00:00:16.290
According to Archbishop Orwell,

00:00:16.290 --> 00:00:21.250
there's a ceremonial hall that can eliminate even
an anomaly like Akari in the ancient capital of Garm.

00:00:21.750 --> 00:00:25.880
Thus, I lied to Akari so that we
could set off together for Garm.

00:00:26.380 --> 00:00:29.080
Go ahead and enjoy the trip, Akari.

00:00:29.250 --> 00:00:31.750
Because when this journey ends, the thing that awaits...

00:00:32.290 --> 00:00:34.790
...is the end of your life.

00:00:35.040 --> 00:00:36.960
<b>Carriage 4</b>

00:02:15.500 --> 00:02:19.790
<b>Episode 3: Taboo in [Red]</b>

00:02:19.920 --> 00:02:21.580
<b>Carriage 1</b>

00:02:19.920 --> 00:02:21.580
<b>VIP Carriage</b>

00:02:26.460 --> 00:02:29.170
What a foolish thing my father has done.

00:02:29.500 --> 00:02:32.630
To think he summoned otherworlders in thirst for power...

00:02:40.000 --> 00:02:41.500
You're Princess Ashuna?

00:02:41.500 --> 00:02:42.750
Indeed.

00:02:42.750 --> 00:02:47.830
I am the youngest daughter of King Grisarika,
Ashuna Grisarika.

00:02:48.630 --> 00:02:49.540
And...

00:02:49.920 --> 00:02:52.080
Who might you lot be?

00:02:52.790 --> 00:02:54.000
<b>Carriage 5</b>

00:02:54.080 --> 00:02:55.000
Listen up!

00:02:55.130 --> 00:02:56.630
You'd better stay quiet!

00:02:56.630 --> 00:02:58.500
You'll get what's coming to you if you resist!

00:02:58.500 --> 00:03:01.380
Menou, what's the deal with those people?

00:03:01.500 --> 00:03:03.670
Some typical dissatisfied members of society.

00:03:03.670 --> 00:03:06.170
I guess you could call them terrorists.

00:03:06.290 --> 00:03:08.170
Does this kind of thing happen a lot?

00:03:08.170 --> 00:03:09.880
Of course not.

00:03:09.880 --> 00:03:11.960
Honestly, talk about bad luck.

00:03:12.080 --> 00:03:13.460
Don't you move!

00:03:13.540 --> 00:03:16.000
They have guns in this world, too?

00:03:16.000 --> 00:03:17.460
Those are etheric guns.

00:03:17.460 --> 00:03:19.580
Though they're actually illegal.

00:03:19.580 --> 00:03:20.580
Hey!

00:03:20.960 --> 00:03:23.460
What are you two blabbering on about-

00:03:24.250 --> 00:03:26.130
Crap, a priestess.

00:03:26.130 --> 00:03:28.170
Good day, Mr. Terrorist.

00:03:28.170 --> 00:03:31.000
I'm simply a clergywoman who serves the helpless.

00:03:31.000 --> 00:03:31.830
Is there a problem?

00:03:31.830 --> 00:03:32.880
Get up.

00:03:33.170 --> 00:03:35.290
You priestesses can be dangerous.

00:03:35.290 --> 00:03:37.580
You can start by putting your scripture on the floor.

00:03:38.290 --> 00:03:39.670
And after that...

00:03:40.670 --> 00:03:41.830
Take all your clothes off.

00:03:42.250 --> 00:03:44.880
Who knows what weapons you might be hiding?

00:03:45.670 --> 00:03:50.540
Well, I am hiding a dagger,
so it's not totally unreasonable, but...

00:03:50.750 --> 00:03:51.880
Get on with it!

00:03:51.880 --> 00:03:54.250
Pipe down, will you? I heard you just fine.

00:03:54.540 --> 00:03:56.790
I'll pretend to undress to get his guard down, and then...

00:03:56.790 --> 00:03:58.580
W-wait just a second!

00:03:58.580 --> 00:04:00.380
Don't do anything awful to Menou!

00:04:00.710 --> 00:04:03.000
I'll undress in her place, okay?!

00:04:04.500 --> 00:04:09.330
D-don't worry. I won't let him abuse you, Menou!

00:04:12.880 --> 00:04:14.330
I'm sorry, Akari.

00:04:14.330 --> 00:04:16.380
You're not making any sense.
Could you not talk for a moment?

00:04:16.580 --> 00:04:19.420
Nah, I don't really mind whichever.

00:04:19.500 --> 00:04:22.080
Lay off. She's just an ordinary girl.

00:04:22.290 --> 00:04:25.250
What you want is to disarm me, isn't it?

00:04:25.460 --> 00:04:28.040
For starters, here's my scripture.

00:04:28.170 --> 00:04:29.500
There, here you GO!

00:04:31.080 --> 00:04:32.080
W-why you...!

00:04:34.960 --> 00:04:36.000
Menou, you're amaz-

00:04:36.000 --> 00:04:36.830
Shh!

00:04:37.170 --> 00:04:38.830
Please keep quiet, everyone.

00:04:38.830 --> 00:04:41.790
There might be more of them in the other carriages.

00:04:44.130 --> 00:04:45.460
That should do it.

00:04:46.330 --> 00:04:47.920
Listen Akari...

00:04:47.920 --> 00:04:50.710
You're a fool if you think you could protect me.

00:04:50.710 --> 00:04:53.330
Don't do anything dangerous, all right?

00:04:53.330 --> 00:04:54.630
S-sure...

00:04:54.880 --> 00:04:56.210
I'm sorry.

00:04:56.830 --> 00:04:57.880
But...

00:04:58.170 --> 00:04:59.330
Thanks anyway.

00:04:59.330 --> 00:05:02.040
It made me happy that you were so brave, Akari.

00:05:03.210 --> 00:05:07.960
Well then, I'm going to go take out the others,
so be a good girl and wait here.

00:05:08.330 --> 00:05:09.130
Menou!

00:05:10.460 --> 00:05:11.830
Please be careful.

00:05:11.830 --> 00:05:14.880
I don't want to be left behind anymore!

00:05:15.210 --> 00:05:17.790
I'll be fine. See you soon.

00:05:21.330 --> 00:05:22.540
"Anymore"?

00:05:29.420 --> 00:05:30.580
<b>Carriage 2</b>

00:05:32.880 --> 00:05:38.080
What an unlucky gang of idiots.
<i>You just had to choose this train to attack.</i><b></b>

00:05:38.750 --> 00:05:42.880
Now, tell me what you want
and how many of you there are.

00:05:42.880 --> 00:05:43.960
No way...

00:05:44.420 --> 00:05:47.290
Not to a little brat like you...

00:05:47.960 --> 00:05:51.130
Oh, I see how it is. If you're not going to talk...

00:05:51.580 --> 00:05:54.380
I'm going to start sawing at your throat with this.

00:05:55.880 --> 00:05:59.670
Let's see if you start talking,
or if I'll saw off that head of yours first.

00:05:59.670 --> 00:06:02.710
Which will it be, I wonder?

00:06:04.080 --> 00:06:05.750
<b>Carriage 4</b>

00:06:05.000 --> 00:06:05.750
I see...

00:06:05.920 --> 00:06:09.000
So they're after the Princess Ashuna Grisarika.

00:06:09.210 --> 00:06:09.920
Yes...

00:06:10.420 --> 00:06:16.000
They intended to take her hostage and demand
the release of their captured terrorist leader.

00:06:16.210 --> 00:06:17.920
How idiotic.

00:06:17.920 --> 00:06:19.290
How many of them are there?

00:06:19.420 --> 00:06:21.170
Thirteen in all.

00:06:21.170 --> 00:06:25.580
Five went to the first class carriage where the princess is,
and two went to the engine room.

00:06:26.000 --> 00:06:29.790
For starters, I'll go secure the engine room.

00:06:27.250 --> 00:06:29.830
<b>VIP Carriage</b>

00:06:27.250 --> 00:06:29.830
<b>Carriage 1</b>

00:06:29.880 --> 00:06:31.710
Yes, please do that.

00:06:31.920 --> 00:06:33.170
Miss!

00:06:33.630 --> 00:06:36.540
Thank you for getting rid of the bad guys!

00:06:37.420 --> 00:06:39.040
You're very welcome.

00:06:48.580 --> 00:06:49.710
Oh?

00:06:49.920 --> 00:06:52.880
What an adorable but unexpected guest.

00:06:53.330 --> 00:06:54.920
Good day to you.

00:06:55.210 --> 00:06:58.290
I'm a princess of the kingdom
and a knight in my own right-

00:06:58.290 --> 00:07:01.830
Your Highness, the Princess Knight Ashuna Grisarika.

00:07:01.830 --> 00:07:03.960
Your fame precedes you.

00:07:04.040 --> 00:07:04.960
Oh?

00:07:05.130 --> 00:07:06.210
And who might you be?

00:07:06.290 --> 00:07:08.460
A priestess by the name of Momo.

00:07:08.460 --> 00:07:10.500
I'm a white robe, as you can see.

00:07:10.500 --> 00:07:12.540
An inexperienced novice.

00:07:13.540 --> 00:07:17.790
I like the alterations you've done to your priestess robe.

00:07:18.420 --> 00:07:21.290
The human body is beautiful as it is.

00:07:21.290 --> 00:07:25.710
Clothing is meant to show off the beauty
of the bodyline instead of concealing it.

00:07:25.880 --> 00:07:27.580
That's very kind of you.

00:07:27.710 --> 00:07:30.920
But how fortuitous that you came at this moment.

00:07:31.580 --> 00:07:34.380
There's something I wish to ask you.

00:07:38.380 --> 00:07:40.460
What is it you want?

00:07:41.080 --> 00:07:42.380
Oh, not much.

00:07:42.710 --> 00:07:46.540
It's just that my father is on trial for heresy at the moment.

00:07:46.540 --> 00:07:49.790
I have something of a bone to pick with the Faust.

00:07:50.210 --> 00:07:53.210
Is that Momo... and Princess Ashuna?

00:07:53.830 --> 00:07:55.710
I have heard that is the case.

00:07:55.790 --> 00:07:59.210
But we have yet to know whether
your father actually committed heresy-

00:08:02.130 --> 00:08:04.580
Oh? This is a surprise.

00:08:04.670 --> 00:08:06.420
What's... this...?

00:08:06.420 --> 00:08:10.710
You intend to cut a priestess down just
because you have beef with the Faust?

00:08:10.830 --> 00:08:13.210
I intended to stop short, of course.

00:08:13.210 --> 00:08:17.040
If I had swung this royal crested sword with full force,

00:08:17.040 --> 00:08:19.920
you know a mere fret saw blade
would never have stopped it.

00:08:20.080 --> 00:08:22.210
You're awfully self-confident.

00:08:22.460 --> 00:08:25.040
Then what's the big idea?

00:08:25.630 --> 00:08:26.920
Are they arguing?

00:08:27.080 --> 00:08:29.960
Well, I suppose Momo will be fine on her own.

00:08:31.250 --> 00:08:34.130
I guess I'll have to go to the engine room instead.

00:08:34.460 --> 00:08:40.380
The otherworlders who my father supposedly
summoned are nowhere to be seen.

00:08:40.380 --> 00:08:43.500
Perhaps they have been eliminated already...

00:08:44.040 --> 00:08:47.290
...at the hands of those infamous
Executioners of the Faust.

00:08:47.420 --> 00:08:50.750
"Executioners"? We have nothing of the sort.

00:08:51.130 --> 00:08:53.380
Seeing you has made me wonder...

00:08:53.580 --> 00:08:57.380
If the executioner finished her job
and left the royal capital,

00:08:57.380 --> 00:09:00.670
perhaps she would be riding this very train.

00:09:00.750 --> 00:09:03.960
I daresay your imagination has gotten the better of you.

00:09:03.960 --> 00:09:05.080
Has it?

00:09:05.080 --> 00:09:08.830
I have never once doubted the intuition
that the heavens bestow upon me.

00:09:11.080 --> 00:09:11.790
<b><i>Invoke</i></b>

00:09:11.790 --> 00:09:13.250
<b><i>Flameburst</i></b>

00:09:19.880 --> 00:09:21.750
<b><i>Barrier</i></b>

00:09:22.250 --> 00:09:24.670
The Faust truly are skilled.

00:09:25.130 --> 00:09:28.000
Your quick decision to protect your head was brilliant.

00:09:28.710 --> 00:09:30.630
What do you mean?

00:09:30.630 --> 00:09:33.250
I can't have you searing my ribbons now, can I?

00:09:33.580 --> 00:09:36.750
A girl's sense of style is all-important, you know.

00:09:36.920 --> 00:09:40.130
You think so, too? I enjoy dressing lavishly myself.

00:09:40.130 --> 00:09:45.580
I don't want some rich girl likening her causal
indulgence for finery with my sense of fashion.

00:09:45.920 --> 00:09:49.420
I like all things strong and beautiful.

00:09:49.420 --> 00:09:53.790
Obviously, your strength is worthy
of my attention too, Momo.

00:09:54.830 --> 00:09:56.250
Ugh, no thanks.

00:09:58.880 --> 00:09:59.580
<b><i>Double Invoke</i></b>

00:09:59.580 --> 00:10:00.880
<b><i>Anchor, Oscillation</i></b>

00:10:02.750 --> 00:10:05.250
You've decided to indulge me, after all?

00:10:05.250 --> 00:10:10.960
Would you like to see how long that arcane
<i>royal trinket of yours can manage against this?!</i><b></b>

00:10:12.040 --> 00:10:13.580
It's good to see you're both all right.

00:10:13.750 --> 00:10:16.420
Sorry we had you concerned, Priestess!

00:10:16.420 --> 00:10:19.420
As you can see we're all fine here,
including the etheric engine.

00:10:19.630 --> 00:10:22.710
Our Princess Knight knocked 'em out in one blow!

00:10:22.710 --> 00:10:23.580
You know her?

00:10:23.580 --> 00:10:26.670
Princess Ashuna,
famous for going 'round righting wrongs!

00:10:26.790 --> 00:10:30.170
Why yes, I know of her. It's unfortunate I just missed-

00:10:31.250 --> 00:10:33.420
You there, you're only pretending you're knocked out.

00:10:33.420 --> 00:10:35.420
What do you have implanted in your bodies?

00:10:38.630 --> 00:10:39.960
Busted, eh?

00:10:39.960 --> 00:10:41.540
But you're too late.

00:10:41.750 --> 00:10:44.540
If we don't make it to Garm we're
gonna be hanged, anyway!

00:10:45.960 --> 00:10:50.000
Everyone on this train is going down with us!

00:10:51.580 --> 00:10:52.710
It can't be...

00:10:52.710 --> 00:10:54.830
Is that a primary red gem?

00:10:56.250 --> 00:10:59.500
We were told to swallow them, just in case!

00:11:17.580 --> 00:11:19.380
Get out of here before you get sucked in!

00:11:19.420 --> 00:11:21.420
B-but if we leave our stations...

00:11:21.420 --> 00:11:23.790
I'll figure it out! Hurry!

00:11:25.330 --> 00:11:27.210
We'll leave it to you, Priestess!

00:11:32.290 --> 00:11:34.330
<b><i>Ether:</i></b>

00:11:32.290 --> 00:11:34.330
<b><i>Merge Materials</i></b>

00:11:37.000 --> 00:11:38.790
<b><i>Activate</i></b>

00:11:37.000 --> 00:11:38.790
<b><i>[Primary Red,</i></b>

00:11:38.790 --> 00:11:40.790
<b><i>Armored Knight]</i></b>

00:12:23.750 --> 00:12:26.210
It may not have technique but it's got brute force.

00:12:26.580 --> 00:12:29.580
At least it didn't manifest as an angel or a dragon,
I suppose.

00:12:30.130 --> 00:12:33.210
If I can just buy some time to wear it down...!

00:12:34.380 --> 00:12:36.540
<i>Jeez, is Momo still fighting?</i>

00:12:40.250 --> 00:12:43.710
What's wrong, Momo?
You've done nothing but evade so far.

00:12:46.290 --> 00:12:49.750
Could you please stop calling me by my name?

00:12:49.750 --> 00:12:52.250
Okay, widdle princess?

00:12:55.960 --> 00:12:57.380
<i>Now that was interesting!</i>

00:12:57.540 --> 00:12:59.080
I don't want to hear it!

00:13:05.790 --> 00:13:08.000
Seemingly haphazard but actually
thoroughly calculated...

00:13:08.250 --> 00:13:11.000
You used magecraft to make it
come flying back, didn't you?

00:13:12.250 --> 00:13:13.460
But before it does...!

00:13:15.170 --> 00:13:15.420
<b><i>Anchor, Oscillation</i></b>

00:13:16.460 --> 00:13:18.880
Are you sure about this, Momo?
I'll force this blade right through.

00:13:18.880 --> 00:13:21.830
I'd like to see you try.

00:13:22.920 --> 00:13:24.000
Did her saw blade do this?!

00:13:33.790 --> 00:13:34.710
Serves you rig-

00:13:35.460 --> 00:13:37.750
You crappy little princess!

00:13:45.330 --> 00:13:46.420
Momo...?

00:13:48.420 --> 00:13:50.290
Ooh, ouch...

00:13:50.880 --> 00:13:53.710
Even with etheric enhancement, that was pretty rough...

00:13:56.210 --> 00:13:57.960
If only you had died.

00:13:58.170 --> 00:14:01.830
With all my training,
a trifle like this isn't enough to do me in.

00:14:01.830 --> 00:14:02.880
Same goes for you, doesn't it?

00:14:12.830 --> 00:14:14.210
The control valve!

00:14:18.830 --> 00:14:20.630
You stupid doll!

00:14:23.630 --> 00:14:25.710
It's out of control. That's not good.

00:14:25.710 --> 00:14:26.880
At this rate...

00:14:27.210 --> 00:14:31.630
This train will run off the rails,
or crash into another train at a station...!

00:14:32.500 --> 00:14:34.170
I don't have the time to be dealing with this thing!

00:14:48.960 --> 00:14:50.330
What on earth?

00:14:50.880 --> 00:14:52.130
What was that?

00:14:52.630 --> 00:14:54.790
That was... disturbing.

00:14:55.580 --> 00:14:59.170
Just now, something bizarre just happened.

00:14:59.420 --> 00:15:01.080
That's all I can tell.

00:15:01.420 --> 00:15:04.040
But this... feels familiar somehow...

00:15:04.540 --> 00:15:05.880
Menou!

00:15:06.250 --> 00:15:07.460
Akari!

00:15:14.000 --> 00:15:14.630
<b><i>Invoke</i></b>

00:15:14.630 --> 00:15:15.540
<b><i>Gale</i></b>

00:15:20.000 --> 00:15:22.710
T-thanks. You're so strong, Menou!

00:15:22.710 --> 00:15:24.460
But what's the deal with that red person?!

00:15:24.460 --> 00:15:26.080
More importantly...

00:15:26.250 --> 00:15:28.580
Why did you come? Answer me!

00:15:28.670 --> 00:15:33.040
W-well, because the men tied
up suddenly got all mangled

00:15:33.040 --> 00:15:35.960
and the red lights went
towards the front of the train...

00:15:35.960 --> 00:15:38.750
So why would you go after them?!

00:15:38.750 --> 00:15:41.790
I told you to be a good girl and stay where you were,
remember?!

00:15:41.880 --> 00:15:46.630
I was a good girl just worried about you, Menou!
You should be proud of me!

00:15:46.630 --> 00:15:48.250
Why would I be proud?!

00:15:49.790 --> 00:15:52.580
If Akari were to get taken in by that thing,

00:15:52.580 --> 00:15:55.330
I'll have worse to worry about than
the train not being able to stop!

00:15:58.290 --> 00:15:59.460
This is such a hassle!

00:16:01.040 --> 00:16:03.290
I didn't really want to do this...

00:16:04.920 --> 00:16:05.580
<b><i>Double Invoke</i></b>

00:16:05.580 --> 00:16:07.750
<b><i>Thread, Gale</i></b>

00:16:11.790 --> 00:16:13.960
I'm going to channel my ether into it!

00:16:16.630 --> 00:16:17.380
<b><i>Command</i></b>

00:16:17.380 --> 00:16:19.830
<b><i>Self Destruct</i></b>

00:16:26.040 --> 00:16:29.630
Of course. It won't let me in that easily.

00:16:29.630 --> 00:16:30.250
But...!

00:16:30.630 --> 00:16:33.670
<b><i>Etheric Connect-Scripture,</i></b>

00:16:30.630 --> 00:16:33.670
<b><i>10:9-Invoke</i></b>

00:16:30.630 --> 00:16:33.670
<b><i>[For so long as thou seekest bliss,</i></b>

00:16:30.630 --> 00:16:33.670
<b><i>there will be one to bear thy calamity.]</i></b>

00:16:34.540 --> 00:16:35.250
<b><i>Self Destruct</i></b>

00:16:41.330 --> 00:16:43.420
There! Now perish!

00:17:00.580 --> 00:17:02.790
Wow! Amazing, Menou!

00:17:03.330 --> 00:17:04.960
If you hadn't come,

00:17:04.960 --> 00:17:07.750
I could have taken it down
without using this much ether...

00:17:08.500 --> 00:17:10.380
Could it be I was in the way or somethi-?

00:17:10.880 --> 00:17:12.670
Totally in the way!

00:17:12.670 --> 00:17:13.960
S-sowwy!

00:17:16.380 --> 00:17:18.710
It's still out of control...

00:17:18.710 --> 00:17:20.250
I have to do something.

00:17:26.880 --> 00:17:31.040
I could use magecraft to stop the train,
but I've used too much ether.

00:17:31.500 --> 00:17:35.750
I just don't have enough energy left
to conjure on a scale that big...

00:17:43.630 --> 00:17:44.500
Akari...

00:17:44.500 --> 00:17:45.790
Hmm? What's up?

00:17:46.580 --> 00:17:51.210
M-Menou, don't stare at me so
intently or you'll make me blush!

00:17:51.750 --> 00:17:54.880
I know this shouldn't really be allowed...

00:17:56.830 --> 00:17:59.710
Akari, will you trust me?

00:18:00.710 --> 00:18:01.710
Of course!

00:18:01.710 --> 00:18:04.630
I always trust you, Menou!

00:18:04.790 --> 00:18:07.880
Then listen to what I'm about to say.

00:18:11.170 --> 00:18:13.130
M-M-M-M-Menou?!

00:18:13.250 --> 00:18:16.040
Why are we here?! It's freaking me out!

00:18:16.040 --> 00:18:17.580
Calm down, Akari.

00:18:17.580 --> 00:18:20.830
I can't! It doesn't help that you're looking all stern!

00:18:22.080 --> 00:18:23.210
Is this better?

00:18:24.750 --> 00:18:28.210
You definitely look cuter when you smile, Menou.

00:18:28.750 --> 00:18:31.960
Your smile's so dippy, it's as if nothing bad's happening.

00:18:32.130 --> 00:18:33.790
You mean that as a compliment, right?

00:18:33.790 --> 00:18:34.960
Of course.

00:18:35.210 --> 00:18:41.210
Akari, I don't have nearly enough ether to
cast the magecraft needed to stop this train.

00:18:41.330 --> 00:18:44.040
So I want to borrow some of yours.

00:18:44.040 --> 00:18:45.460
O-okay...

00:18:45.790 --> 00:18:47.380
This will hurt a lot.

00:18:47.380 --> 00:18:52.210
A person's body always reacts violently when
connecting one's ether to someone else's.

00:18:52.210 --> 00:18:53.250
I'm sorry.

00:18:53.250 --> 00:18:57.630
Well, I don't like pain... but will you be okay, Menou?

00:18:57.830 --> 00:18:58.880
I'll be fine.

00:18:58.880 --> 00:19:02.630
You see, I lost most of who I was a long time ago.

00:19:04.250 --> 00:19:08.460
That's why I can connect my ether
to others without any pain.

00:19:09.130 --> 00:19:10.000
Got it.

00:19:10.420 --> 00:19:12.290
Then I'll be okay, too.

00:19:12.290 --> 00:19:14.750
I'm fine leaving everything up to you, Menou.

00:19:15.210 --> 00:19:16.380
Thanks!

00:19:19.710 --> 00:19:21.000
Let's do this.

00:19:21.000 --> 00:19:21.710
Okay.

00:19:23.250 --> 00:19:26.380
<b><i>Etheric Connect-Scripture,</i></b>

00:19:23.250 --> 00:19:26.380
<b><i>8:12-Remote Invoke</i></b>

00:19:23.250 --> 00:19:26.380
<b><i>[Kneel before the front gate,</i></b>

00:19:23.250 --> 00:19:26.380
<b><i>for its path leads to the Lord.]</i></b>

00:19:26.460 --> 00:19:29.290
First, I'm going to embed my magecraft
into the earthen vein.

00:19:33.170 --> 00:19:37.500
Then, I conjure a gate to draw the train to it,
and add more power!

00:19:37.750 --> 00:19:39.170
Here we go, Akari!

00:19:41.250 --> 00:19:41.880
<b><i>Etheric Connect-Scripture,</i></b>

00:19:41.250 --> 00:19:41.880
<b><i>8:12-Remote Invoke</i></b>

00:19:41.250 --> 00:19:41.880
<b><i>[Kneel before the front gate,</i></b>

00:19:41.250 --> 00:19:41.880
<b><i>for its path leads to the Lord.]</i></b>

00:19:42.460 --> 00:19:45.170
<b><i>Etheric Connect</i></b>

00:19:42.460 --> 00:19:45.170
<b><i>-Akari Tokitou-</i></b>

00:19:42.460 --> 00:19:45.170
<b><i>Extract</i></b>

00:19:42.460 --> 00:19:45.170
<b><i>[Force]</i></b>

00:19:53.710 --> 00:19:54.830
Incredible...

00:19:54.830 --> 00:19:57.330
So this is the sheer amount of
ether otherworlders have.

00:19:59.790 --> 00:20:01.420
This tickles...

00:20:01.420 --> 00:20:04.250
And her body's isn't reacting that violently at all.

00:20:04.830 --> 00:20:07.130
But there's no time to be surprised. Not right now!

00:20:07.330 --> 00:20:11.630
<b><i>Medium, Menou</i></b>

00:20:07.330 --> 00:20:11.630
<b><i>-Etheric Boost-</i></b>

00:20:07.340 --> 00:20:11.630
<b><i>Maintain Invoke</i></b>

00:20:07.340 --> 00:20:11.630
<b><i>[Kneel before the front gate,</i></b>

00:20:07.340 --> 00:20:11.630
<b><i>for its path leads to the Lord.]</i></b>

00:20:19.000 --> 00:20:20.080
Menou...

00:20:20.290 --> 00:20:21.460
Menou...

00:20:21.790 --> 00:20:22.880
Please!

00:20:45.500 --> 00:20:46.420
Menou!

00:20:46.580 --> 00:20:49.130
You did it. Wow, Menou. You're amazing!

00:20:50.920 --> 00:20:52.420
Of course.

00:20:52.710 --> 00:20:57.290
Because priestesses are supposed
to be pure, just, and strong!

00:21:06.750 --> 00:21:11.670
The heavens must truly smile down upon me,
to have allowed this encounter with you!

00:21:11.670 --> 00:21:13.960
Now, what will your next move be?!

00:21:15.040 --> 00:21:18.420
I've gotten involved with such a nuisance...

00:21:20.710 --> 00:21:23.420
We're currently preparing a substitute train.

00:21:23.420 --> 00:21:25.330
Please hold on for just a while longer!

00:21:25.920 --> 00:21:27.040
Miss!

00:21:27.040 --> 00:21:29.040
Millie! It's so great that you're safe!

00:21:29.130 --> 00:21:31.000
Yeah! You too!

00:21:31.540 --> 00:21:35.630
What if I had failed to stop the train?

00:21:39.250 --> 00:21:43.580
Maybe that actually happened once.

00:21:44.500 --> 00:21:47.880
Maybe I died, along with all the other passengers...

00:21:48.420 --> 00:21:49.880
And then maybe Akari...

00:21:50.330 --> 00:21:53.250
Turned back time?

00:21:58.080 --> 00:21:59.210
Akari.

00:21:59.630 --> 00:22:04.460
Just what kind of power does your
Pure Concept have concealed within?

00:23:36.040 --> 00:23:40.380
<b>Next Episode</b>

00:23:36.040 --> 00:23:40.380
<b>The Ancient Capital Garm</b>

00:23:36.500 --> 00:23:39.330
Next Episode: The Ancient Capital Garm.
